msgstr ""

#. translators: Option in a dropdown of the deleting-content table on the WPML Settings screen: only the document being deleted goes, not its translations.
msgid "Only that one"
msgstr ""

#. translators: Option in a dropdown of the deleting-content table on the WPML Settings screen: the document goes in every language. Verb, imperative.
