msgstr ""

#. translators: Column heading in the deleting-content table on the WPML Settings screen; the column names the kind of content each row is about.
msgid "Content"
msgstr ""

msgid "Deleting an original"
msgstr ""

msgid "Deleting a translation"
msgstr ""

msgid "Deleting a translation never removes any other language — not the original, and not the other translations."
msgstr ""

#. translators: Button label that saves what is on the screen, used across WPML's screens. Verb, imperative.
msgid "Save"
msgstr ""

#. translators: Button label while a save is running; it replaces "Save" on the same button. Keep the ellipsis.
msgid "Saving…"
msgstr ""

#. translators: Shown next to the Save button on the WPML Settings screen once the settings are saved. Keep the full stop.
msgid "Saved."
msgstr ""

#. translators: Shown next to the Save button on the WPML Settings screen when the save failed. The server's own error message, in English, is added after it.
msgid "Could not save."
msgstr ""
